#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 190 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 Data type for sound envelope. Contains points specified
by time and value. Points could have stop property - to execute oly
part of envelope and stop on this point. So multisegment envelopes
could be created;
#X text 240 153 Point also has segment type property \, that defines
following segment curve - it could be *step* \, *line* (default) or
*exp* (exponential);
#X text 240 208 Exponential segment also has curve property: if 0 -
(linear) <0 (concave \, negatively curved) >0 (convex \, positively
curved);
